                        "entry_id": "eaffd947-bc4a-3da4-98c5-e29f5bc66faa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "dense forest, thicket, jungle"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1af7c0c-be0a-44a3-99ab-ef9a35e27f13",
                                "sense_id": "2979d4fc-e59c-3c6c-9aa6-f48ddcf68c48",
                                "text": "Партизаны врага обскакали!\nИ, опять кончивъ бой,\nмы въ трущобѣ лѣсной\nОтдыхать, подкрѣпить остались.",
                                "translation": "The partisans overtook the enemy!\nAnd, ending the battle again,\nWe left in the dense forest\nTo kick back and gain energy.",
                                "english": "The partisans overtook the enemy!\nAnd, ending the battle again,\nWe left in the dense forest\nTo kick back and gain energy."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
